{"id":"n70493-1-7","stage":2,"title":"어르신 · 令尊","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70493-1-7-1","ko":"오늘이 어르신 생신 아닌가?","zh":"今天不是长辈的生日吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘이","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘이","audio":"/audio/c4a432f0e61abb21e6b8.mp3"}},{"text":"어르신","meaning":"令尊","explanation":"어르신：令尊","readings":[{"term":"어르신","audio":"/audio/b48d927c3256dc3fc017.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70493","senseId":"1","lemma":"어르신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어르신","audio":"/audio/b48d927c3256dc3fc017.mp3"}},{"text":"생신","meaning":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","explanation":"생신：寿辰，诞辰，生日","readings":[{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16595","senseId":"1","lemma":"생신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}},{"text":"아닌가?","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"아닌가","audio":"/audio/aa34b45a0ee85c98a38d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아닌가","audio":"/audio/aa34b45a0ee85c98a38d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"b48d927c3256dc3f","term":"어르신","zh":"令尊","audio":"/audio/b48d927c3256dc3fc017.mp3","entryId":"70493","definition":"(敬语)他人的父亲。","pronunciation":["어ː르신"]},{"id":"17bf3766fa611ae9","term":"생신","zh":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3","entryId":"16595","definition":"(敬语)人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생신"]}],"audio":"/audio/89dba5cc05a4f03775f3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70493-1-7-2","ko":"아버지